B.acU=new A.hr("EXPERIENCE & ADVANCEMENT",'At the end of each session, answer the end-of-session questions. Each "Yes" grants 1 XP. 5 XP can be spent to increase a Skill by +1 (max 5) or learn a new Talent. Attributes never increase through XP.')
B.acT=new A.hr("COMBAT TURNS & INITIATIVE","Combat takes place in rounds. At the start of combat, 10 unique cards numbered 1\u201310 are dealt to participants. Lowest number acts first. On your turn you get 1 Fast action and 1 Slow action, or 2 Fast actions.")
B.acZ=new A.hr("ZONES & RANGE","Combat distances are divided into four categories: Arm\u2019s Length (hand-to-hand), Near (same zone), Short (adjacent zone), and Long (up to two zones away). Moving between zones requires a fast action.")
