B.abB=new A.dN("bestiary_brook_horse","Brook Horse","B\xe4ckah\xe4sten","Nature Spirits","A majestic, misty-grey stallion found grazing near rushing brooks and misty riverbeds. Its long, silken back magically lengthens to accommodate as many riders as dare mount it, whereupon it bolts into deep water to drown and devour its victims.","Frothing mill streams, foaming rapids, and river fords",12,9,6,9,2,B.Sx,B.VL,B.RV,B.TK,'If a rider utters "Cross" or "Jesus", the horse throws its riders and vanishes in a thunder of river spray.')
