B.TS=s(["The Grim cannot be truly destroyed while the church stands; but it can be put to rest by replacing stolen church relics or repairing violated graves."],t.s)
B.aby=new A.dN("bestiary_church_grim","Church Grim","Kyrkogrim","Undead","A spectral black bull, ram, or hound born from ancient pagan sacrifices buried beneath the cornerstones of medieval churches. It patrols churchyards by midnight, protecting hallowed graves from graverobbers, witches, and profane defilement.","Consecrated churchyards, belfries, and crypt entrances",10,8,7,7,2,B.U9,B.Vt,B.VB,B.TS,"The Grim will ignore investigators who bow before the altar and carry no stolen earth from the graveyard.")
