B.abH=new A.dN("bestiary_ghost","Ghost","Sp\xf6ke / Gast","Undead","The sorrowful or spiteful remnants of a soul bound to the earthly plane by violent murder, suicide, hidden wealth, or an unfulfilled oath. Gasts appear as chilling apparitions or disembodied moans rattling through floorboards.","Manor houses, attics, crossroads, and sites of tragic demise",6,6,8,8,2,B.Vs,B.Vw,B.V6,B.U6,"Ghosts cannot cross lines of table salt or running water without dispelling their ethereal form.")
