B.abF=new A.dN("bestiary_giant","Giant","J\xe4tte","Monstrosities","Ancient, primordial beings of rock and lichen who retreated into remote Scandinavian mountains when the sound of church bells spread across the valleys. Colossal and slow of thought, they can hurl church boulders and level timber barns in single strokes.","Granite peaks, deep cavern vaults, and uninhabited northern fells",15,12,4,6,2,B.SQ,B.UO,B.Tk,B.TU,"Giants possess immense treasure hoard collections of unworked silver and prehistoric gold hidden in mountain clefts.")
