B.abw=new A.dN("bestiary_lindworm","Lindworm","Lindorm","Monstrosities","A monstrous wingless dragon or giant serpent covered in shimmering viridian scales. It lurks beneath barrows and hollow tree trunks, spitting venom that corrodes iron and rolling across hills by biting its own tail like a scythe wheel.","Viking barrows, limestone caves, and ancient burial mounds",14,11,7,8,3,B.Tz,B.T2,B.Uy,B.SN,"The shed skin of a Lindworm confers knowledge of healing herbs and beast-speech if consumed with boiled milk.")
