B.abD=new A.dN("bestiary_myling","Myling","Myling","Undead","The tragic, vengeful ghost of an unbaptized infant murdered by its impoverished mother and hidden under floorboards or in the peat bog. It climbs onto lone travelers\u2019 backs along deserted forest roads, growing heavier with every step until the victim sinks into the muck and dies of exhaustion.","Peat bogs, lonely crossroads, and beneath old timber floorboards",8,6,5,8,2,B.VQ,B.TH,B.TV,B.T0,'If an investigator asks the Myling "What is your name?", it weeps and clings tighter until given a proper name.')
