B.abC=new A.dN("bestiary_night_raven","Night Raven","Nattramn","Undead","A giant, shadowy raven whose hollow breast carries a hole through which stars can be seen. Born from the soul of an unburied suicide or executed criminal, it flies at twilight from east to west, croaking an omen of death that curses anyone who looks through its hollow chest.","Gallows hills, ruined windmills, and evening skies over heathlands",7,6,7,9,2,B.SI,B.Uf,B.TD,B.Vv,"It always flies strictly from East to West and cannot alter its flight path if blinding lantern light strikes its eyes.")
