B.abL=new A.dN("bestiary_nixie","Nixie","N\xe4cken","Nature Spirits","A naked, handsome man sitting on a river rock or submerged log playing enchanting tunes upon a silver violin. His spellbinding melodies compel men, women, and beasts to dance uncontrollably into the deep pools where they drown.","Millponds, dark river bends, and churning waterfall pools",10,8,9,11,2,B.W5,B.Ub,B.Vu,B.SM,"He will teach a willing mortal master-level violin playing in exchange for three drops of blood or a black lamb sacrifice.")
