B.abI=new A.dN("bestiary_spertus","Spertus","Bj\xe4ra / B\xe4ra","Monstrosities","A grotesque, ball-shaped construct of moss, tangled hair, twigs, and wax, brought to life through blood pacts by a malevolent witch. It rolls or scuttles between dairy barns under cover of night, siphoning cream and butter from neighbors\u2019 cows to vomit into its master\u2019s churn.","Cow sheds, dairy cellars, and haylofts",6,5,3,7,1,B.T6,B.TE,B.TI,B.V8,"If you whip the Bj\xe4ra with a rowan branch, it will lead you directly back to the cottage of the witch who created it.")
B.ac7=new A.c4("Troll Glamour (Trollskott)","Slow action","Disguises gold as dried leaves, horse dung as warm loaves, or their hideous forms as charming forest folk.")
B.abN=new A.c4("Changeling Theft","Story trigger","Swaps human newborn infants with aged, voracious troll children who devour all farm grain without growing.")
