B.abG=new A.dN("bestiary_werewolf","Werewolf","Varulv","Monstrosities","A cursed human who has either willingly donned a wolf belt sewn from executed wolf-hide, or been cursed by a scorned lover or malevolent spellcaster. Under moonlight, they transform into a hulking, bloodthirsty predator hunting kin and livestock.","Dense pine forests, snowdrifts, and lonely hunting cabins",14,10,5,6,3,B.U_,B.SE,B.VR,B.Ti,"If wounded by silver, the human form will bear the exact same scar on the following morning.")
