B.abK=new A.dN("bestiary_will_o_the_wisp","Will-o'-the-Wisp","Irrbloss","Nature Spirits","Flickering pale blue, greenish, or golden lanterns drifting over dark marshes and bottomless peat quagmires. They are the souls of greedy surveyors who moved boundary stones in life, doomed to wander and lead lost travelers into watery graves.","Peat marshes, treacherous bogs, and misty marshlands",4,4,6,9,1,B.T1,B.Vf,B.TZ,B.SP,"They cannot cross dry gravel or paved roads, vanishing if brought within range of street lamps.")
