B.a3g=new A.bK("acad_bookworm","Bookworm","Academic","You have read extensive historical, linguistic, and scientific texts.","+2 dice to Learning tests when consulting books, archives, or university records.")
B.a2V=new A.bK("acad_erudite","Erudite","Academic","You can identify the origin and folklore of rare artifacts and symbols.","+2 dice to Investigation tests when examining ancient ruins, inscriptions, or occult symbols.")
B.a3q=new A.bK("acad_focused","Know-It-All","Academic","Your sharp logical deduction grants clarity in moments of panic.","Once per mystery, you can use Logic instead of Empathy when making a Fear Test.")
B.a3i=new A.bK("doc_field_surgeon","Army Medic","Doctor","You are accustomed to treating severe wounds under fire.","+2 dice to Medicine tests when treating lethal Critical Injuries in the field.")
B.a3a=new A.bK("doc_calm_demeanor","Calm Demeanor","Doctor","Your scientific training shields you from losing your composure.","You ignore the dice penalty from one Mental Condition of your choice.")
B.a3s=new A.bK("doc_anatomist","Autopsy Specialist","Doctor","Examining corpses reveals supernatural poisons, curses, and weaknesses.","+2 dice to Investigation or Medicine when examining remains or corpses of victims.")
B.a3l=new A.bK("hunt_marksman","Marksman","Hunter","Your aim is steady and lethal from long range.","+2 dice to Ranged Combat when aiming at Short or Long range before firing.")
B.a39=new A.bK("hunt_tracker","Bloodhound","Hunter","No beast can conceal its tracks from your keen wilderness senses.","+2 dice to Vigilance when tracking beasts or vaesen through wilderness terrain.")
B.a3f=new A.bK("hunt_trapper","Trapper","Hunter","You know how to construct snares, cold-iron traps, and deadfalls.","+2 dice to Force or Agility when setting or disarming snares and traps.")
B.a2W=new A.bK("occ_sixth_sense","Sixth Sense","Occultist","You feel a cold tingle at the nape of your neck when supernatural evil is near.","The GM must inform you if a Vaesen is hiding in your immediate vicinity before an ambush.")
B.a2Y=new A.bK("occ_seance","Medium","Occultist","You can communicate with lingering ghosts and restless spirits.","+2 dice to Observation when attempting to speak to or perceive spiritual manifestations.")
B.a3k=new A.bK("occ_banisher","Ritualist","Occultist","You know the precise incantations and symbols required for banishing rituals.","+2 dice to Learning or Inspiration during the execution of a Vaesen banishment ritual.")
B.a32=new A.bK("off_lead_from_front","Lead from the Front","Officer","Your commanding presence inspires courage in your fellow investigators.","When you succeed at an Inspiration test, you can heal 1 Mental Condition on two allies at once.")
B.a38=new A.bK("off_tactician","Tactician","Officer","You quickly read the battlefield and deploy allies effectively.","+2 dice to Vigilance when drawing initiative cards in tactical encounters.")
B.a3j=new A.bK("off_fencing","Duelist","Officer","Mastery of sabres, rapiers, and dueling blades.","+2 dice to Close Combat when wielding a single-handed blade in a one-on-one duel.")
B.a3n=new A.bK("priest_absolution","Absolution","Priest","You offer soothing spiritual grace to souls in deep despair.","Once per session, you can remove the Hopeless or Broken (Mental) condition from an ally with a prayer.")
B.a30=new A.bK("priest_holy_aura","Holy Ward","Priest","Holding your crucifix or sacred symbol cowers unholy spirits.","+2 dice to Fear tests for you and all allies in your immediate zone.")
B.a3o=new A.bK("priest_confessor","Confessor","Priest","People naturally feel compelled to bare their souls and secrets to you.","+2 dice to Manipulation when encouraging people to confess truths or secret guilt.")
B.a35=new A.bK("det_sherlock","Deductive Leap","Private Detective","You spot tiny details\u2014mud splatters, ash types, scuffed shoe leather.","Extra successes (stunts) on Investigation grant two clues instead of one.")
B.a36=new A.bK("det_shadow","Tail / Shadow","Private Detective","You blend into crowds and city alleys without drawing attention.","+2 dice to Stealth when shadowing a suspect through populated streets or markets.")
B.a3h=new A.bK("det_interrogator","Hard-Boiled Interrogator","Private Detective","You know exactly when a suspect is lying through their teeth.","+2 dice to Observation when questioning suspects and detecting deception.")
B.a3d=new A.bK("serv_unnoticed","Blends In","Servant","Aristocrats, guards, and society disregard you as mere help.","+2 dice to Stealth and Observation in high-society manors, balls, and hotels.")
B.a3b=new A.bK("serv_packmule","Pack Mule","Servant","You know how to pack and balance satchels with effortless poise.","Your carrying capacity is Physique + 5 instead of Physique + 2.")
B.a3_=new A.bK("serv_loyal","Loyal Guardian","Servant","You will take a blow meant for your master or companion.","Once per combat, you can intercept an attack directed at an ally in your zone, taking the hit yourself.")
B.a34=new A.bK("vag_survivor","Hardened Survivor","Vagabond","Cold nights, starvation, and beatings have forged iron resilience.","You ignore the dice penalty from one Physical Condition of your choice.")
B.a2X=new A.bK("vag_gutter_fighter","Dirty Fighting","Vagabond","Sand in the eyes, broken bottles, and low blows.","+2 dice to Close Combat when fighting unarmed or using improvised weapons.")
B.a3m=new A.bK("vag_contacts","Underworld Network","Vagabond","You know smugglers, pickpockets, and fences in every town port.","+2 dice to Manipulation when seeking shelter, black-market goods, or street rumors.")
B.a37=new A.bK("writ_eloquent","Eloquent Prose","Writer","Your letters, petitions, and speech command prestige and rapt attention.","+2 dice to Manipulation or Inspiration when delivering formal speeches or written documents.")
B.a2Z=new A.bK("writ_chronicler","Folklore Chronicler","Writer","You have compiled endless accounts of local fireside ghost stories.","+2 dice to Learning tests regarding local myths, ballads, and fairy tales.")
B.a33=new A.bK("writ_tragic_muse","Tragic Muse","Writer","You find poetic beauty in melancholy and dark secrets.","Whenever you bring your Dark Secret into play, you earn +1 extra Experience Point.")
